{"seq":2,"slug":"monad-fundamentals","title":"Monad 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/monad-fundamentals","wordCount":835,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"monad-基础\">Monad 基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Monad</strong> 解决 Functor 遗留的一个问题：当函数本身返回上下文中的值（<code>A → F&lt;B&gt;</code>），<code>map</code> 会产生嵌套 <code>F&lt;F&lt;B&gt;&gt;</code>。<code>flatMap</code> 先映射再抹平一层嵌套，让链式上下文操作保持扁平。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>map</td>\n<td><code>(A→B) → F&lt;A&gt; → F&lt;B&gt;</code></td>\n<td>上下文中的值变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flatMap</td>\n<td><code>(A→F&lt;B&gt;) → F&lt;A&gt; → F&lt;B&gt;</code></td>\n<td>链式上下文操作不产生嵌套</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pure / return</td>\n<td><code>A → F&lt;A&gt;</code></td>\n<td>把普通值放入上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三条定律</td>\n<td>左单位元、右单位元、结合律</td>\n<td>保证链可自由重组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语法糖</td>\n<td>do 语法、async/await、<code>?</code>、for 推导</td>\n<td>Monad 链的命令式外观</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>记住等式 <code>flatMap = map + flatten</code> 就抓住了 Monad 的本质：它让&quot;如何处理上下文&quot;与&quot;如何处理值&quot;彻底分离。Promise 的 <code>.then()</code> 就是 flatMap——日常 JS 开发其实一直在用 Monad。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-functor-到-monad\">从 Functor 到 Monad</h2><p>Functor 的 <code>map</code> 允许我们将函数 <code>A → B</code> 应用到 <code>F&lt;A&gt;</code> 上得到 <code>F&lt;B&gt;</code>。但如果函数本身返回一个包裹在上下文中的值（<code>A → F&lt;B&gt;</code>），map 就会产生嵌套：<code>F&lt;F&lt;B&gt;&gt;</code>。<strong>Monad</strong> 通过 <code>flatMap</code>（也叫 <code>bind</code> 或 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code>）解决了这个问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"class Applicative m =&gt; Monad m where&#10;  (&gt;&gt;=) :: m a -&gt; (a -&gt; m b) -&gt; m b&#10;  return :: a -&gt; m a&#10;&#10;safeDivide :: Double -&gt; Double -&gt; Maybe Double&#10;safeDivide _ 0 = Nothing&#10;safeDivide a b = Just (a / b)&#10;&#10;compute :: Maybe Double&#10;compute = Just 100 &gt;&gt;= \\x -&gt;&#10;          safeDivide x 3 &gt;&gt;= \\y -&gt;&#10;          safeDivide y 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Applicative m => Monad m where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (>>=) :: m a -> (a -> m b) -> m b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return :: a -> m a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safeDivide :: Double -> Double -> Maybe Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safeDivide _ 0 = Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safeDivide a b = Just (a / b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compute :: Maybe Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compute = Just 100 >>= \\x -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          safeDivide x 3 >>= \\y -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          safeDivide y 2</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Option&lt;A&gt; = { tag: &#39;none&#39; } | { tag: &#39;some&#39;; value: A };&#10;&#10;const flatMap =&#10;  &lt;A, B&gt;(f: (a: A) =&gt; Option&lt;B&gt;) =&gt;&#10;  (ma: Option&lt;A&gt;): Option&lt;B&gt; =&gt;&#10;    ma.tag === &#39;none&#39; ? ma : f(ma.value);&#10;&#10;const safeDivide = (a: number, b: number): Option&lt;number&gt; =&gt;&#10;  b === 0 ? { tag: &#39;none&#39; } : { tag: &#39;some&#39;, value: a / b };&#10;&#10;const compute = flatMap((x: number) =&gt; flatMap((y: number) =&gt; safeDivide(y, 2))(safeDivide(x, 3)))({&#10;  tag: &#39;some&#39;,&#10;  value: 100,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'some'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ma.tag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ma.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> safeDivide</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'some'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> compute</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> safeDivide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(y, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">safeDivide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'some'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>类型签名</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>map</td>\n<td><code>(A→B) → F&lt;A&gt; → F&lt;B&gt;</code></td>\n<td>在上下文中变换值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flatMap</td>\n<td><code>(A→F&lt;B&gt;) → F&lt;A&gt; → F&lt;B&gt;</code></td>\n<td>链式上下文操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pure/return</td>\n<td><code>A → F&lt;A&gt;</code></td>\n<td>将值放入上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>join/flatten</td>\n<td><code>F&lt;F&lt;A&gt;&gt; → F&lt;A&gt;</code></td>\n<td>解除一层嵌套</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;map 的问题&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;Option&amp;lt;number&amp;gt;&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;map(safeDivide)&quot;| B[&quot;Option&amp;lt;Option&amp;lt;number&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;flatMap 的解决&quot;&#10;        C[&quot;Option&amp;lt;number&amp;gt;&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;flatMap(safeDivide)&quot;| D[&quot;Option&amp;lt;number&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"map 的问题\"\n        A[\"Option&amp;lt;number&amp;gt;\"] --&gt;|\"map(safeDivide)\"| B[\"Option&amp;lt;Option&amp;lt;number&amp;gt;&amp;gt;\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"flatMap 的解决\"\n        C[\"Option&amp;lt;number&amp;gt;\"] --&gt;|\"flatMap(safeDivide)\"| D[\"Option&amp;lt;number&amp;gt;\"]\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>flatMap = map + flatten</code>。如果你理解了 map 会产生嵌套的问题，就理解了 Monad 存在的意义。flatMap 先 map，再 flatten（解除一层嵌套），得到的结果就是扁平的。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"monad-定律\">Monad 定律</h2><p>每个合法的 Monad 必须满足三条定律：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 1. 左单位元律&#10;return a &gt;&gt;= f  ==  f a&#10;&#10;-- 2. 右单位元律&#10;m &gt;&gt;= return  ==  m&#10;&#10;-- 3. 结合律&#10;(m &gt;&gt;= f) &gt;&gt;= g  ==  m &gt;&gt;= (\\x -&gt; f x &gt;&gt;= g)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 1. 左单位元律</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return a >>= f  ==  f a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 2. 右单位元律</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>m >>= return  ==  m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 3. 结合律</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(m >>= f) >>= g  ==  m >>= (\\x -> f x >>= g)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const pure = &lt;A&gt;(a: A): Option&lt;A&gt; =&gt; ({ tag: &#39;some&#39;, value: a });&#10;&#10;const f = (x: number): Option&lt;string&gt; =&gt; ({ tag: &#39;some&#39;, value: x.toString() });&#10;&#10;const law1 = flatMap(f)(pure(5));&#10;const law1b = f(5);&#10;&#10;const m: Option&lt;number&gt; = { tag: &#39;some&#39;, value: 42 };&#10;const law2 = flatMap(pure)(m);&#10;const law2b = m;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pure</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'some'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: a });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'some'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: x.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> law1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f)(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> law1b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Option</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'some'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> law2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pure)(m);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> law2b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定律</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>左单位元</td>\n<td><code>pure(a).flatMap(f) === f(a)</code></td>\n<td>pure 是 flatMap 的左单位元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>右单位元</td>\n<td><code>m.flatMap(pure) === m</code></td>\n<td>pure 是 flatMap 的右单位元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结合律</td>\n<td><code>m.flatMap(f).flatMap(g) === m.flatMap(x =&gt; f(x).flatMap(g))</code></td>\n<td>链的分组不影响结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;左单位元&quot;&#10;        P[&quot;pure(a)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;flatMap(f)&quot;| R1[&quot;f(a)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;右单位元&quot;&#10;        M[&quot;m&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;flatMap(pure)&quot;| R2[&quot;m&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;结合律&quot;&#10;        M2[&quot;m&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;flatMap(f).flatMap(g)&quot;| R3[&quot;结果&quot;]&#10;        M2 --&gt;|&quot;flatMap(x =&gt; f(x).flatMap(g))&quot;| R3&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"左单位元\"\n        P[\"pure(a)\"] --&gt;|\"flatMap(f)\"| R1[\"f(a)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"右单位元\"\n        M[\"m\"] --&gt;|\"flatMap(pure)\"| R2[\"m\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"结合律\"\n        M2[\"m\"] --&gt;|\"flatMap(f).flatMap(g)\"| R3[\"结果\"]\n        M2 --&gt;|\"flatMap(x =&gt; f(x).flatMap(g))\"| R3\n    end</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Monad 定律的本质是保证 flatMap 链可以自由重组而不改变结果。这就像数学中的结合律 <code>(a+b)+c = a+(b+c)</code>——它让你可以安全地重构 Monad 链。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"do-语法与-async-await\">do 语法与 async/await</h2><p>Haskell 的 <strong>do 语法</strong>是 Monad 链式调用的语法糖，让代码看起来像命令式编程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 用 &gt;&gt;= 链式调用&#10;compute :: Maybe Double&#10;compute = Just 100 &gt;&gt;= \\x -&gt;&#10;          safeDivide x 3 &gt;&gt;= \\y -&gt;&#10;          safeDivide y 2&#10;&#10;-- 用 do 语法（等价）&#10;compute :: Maybe Double&#10;compute = do&#10;  x &lt;- Just 100&#10;  y &lt;- safeDivide x 3&#10;  safeDivide y 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 用 >>= 链式调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compute :: Maybe Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compute = Just 100 >>= \\x -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          safeDivide x 3 >>= \\y -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          safeDivide y 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 用 do 语法（等价）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compute :: Maybe Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compute = do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x &#x3C;- Just 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  y &#x3C;- safeDivide x 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  safeDivide y 2</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const asyncCompute = async (): Promise&lt;number&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const x = await fetchNumber();&#10;  const y = await processNumber(x);&#10;  const z = await finalStep(y);&#10;  return z;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> asyncCompute</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> finalStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>本质</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>do 语法</td>\n<td>Haskell</td>\n<td>Monad bind 的语法糖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>for 推导</td>\n<td>Scala</td>\n<td>flatMap + map 的语法糖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>async/await</td>\n<td>JS/TS/Rust</td>\n<td>Promise/Future Monad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算表达式</td>\n<td>F#</td>\n<td>通用 Monad 语法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>?</code> 运算符</td>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>Result Monad 的语法糖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;do 语法 = 语法糖&quot;&#10;        DO[&quot;do { x &lt;- m1; y &lt;- m2 x; return (x+y) }&quot;]&#10;        DESUGAR[&quot;m1 &gt;&gt;= \\\\x -&gt; m2 x &gt;&gt;= \\\\y -&gt; return (x+y)&quot;]&#10;        DO --&gt;|脱糖| DESUGAR&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"do 语法 = 语法糖\"\n        DO[\"do { x &lt;- m1; y &lt;- m2 x; return (x+y) }\"]\n        DESUGAR[\"m1 &gt;&gt;= \\\\x -&gt; m2 x &gt;&gt;= \\\\y -&gt; return (x+y)\"]\n        DO --&gt;|脱糖| DESUGAR\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"monad-的直觉模型\">Monad 的直觉模型</h2><p>理解 Monad 最有效的方式是建立多种直觉模型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const chainOption = &lt;A, B&gt;(ma: Option&lt;A&gt;, f: (a: A) =&gt; Option&lt;B&gt;): Option&lt;B&gt; =&gt; (ma.tag === &#39;none&#39; ? ma : f(ma.value));&#10;&#10;const chainArray = &lt;A, B&gt;(ma: A[], f: (a: A) =&gt; B[]): B[] =&gt; ma.flatMap(f);&#10;&#10;const chainPromise = &lt;A, B&gt;(ma: Promise&lt;A&gt;, f: (a: A) =&gt; Promise&lt;B&gt;): Promise&lt;B&gt; =&gt; ma.then(f);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chainOption</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><sp