a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ma.value));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chainArray</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ma.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chainPromise</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">B</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ma.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>直觉模型</th>\n<th>Monad 实例</th>\n<th>上下文含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可能失败的计算</td>\n<td>Maybe/Option</td>\n<td>值可能不存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带错误的计算</td>\n<td>Either/Result</td>\n<td>计算可能产生错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多结果的计算</td>\n<td>List/Array</td>\n<td>计算可能有多个结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步计算</td>\n<td>Promise/Task</td>\n<td>值需要等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有副作用的计算</td>\n<td>IO</td>\n<td>计算涉及外部世界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带环境的计算</td>\n<td>Reader</td>\n<td>计算需要读取配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带状态的计算</td>\n<td>State</td>\n<td>计算需要读写状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Promise 的 <code>.then()</code> 实质上就是 Monad 的 <code>flatMap</code>——它接受一个返回 Promise 的函数，将两个异步操作串联起来，不会产生 <code>Promise&lt;Promise&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code> 嵌套。JavaScript 开发者其实每天都在使用 Monad。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Monad 基础))&#10;    核心操作&#10;      flatMap / bind&#10;      pure / return&#10;      join / flatten&#10;    解决问题&#10;      嵌套上下文&#10;      链式计算&#10;      上下文传播&#10;    定律&#10;      左单位元&#10;      右单位元&#10;      结合律&#10;    语法糖&#10;      do 语法&#10;      async/await&#10;      for 推导&#10;      ? 运算符&#10;    直觉&#10;      可能失败&#10;      异步&#10;      多结果&#10;      带状态\">mindmap\n  root((Monad 基础))\n    核心操作\n      flatMap / bind\n      pure / return\n      join / flatten\n    解决问题\n      嵌套上下文\n      链式计算\n      上下文传播\n    定律\n      左单位元\n      右单位元\n      结合律\n    语法糖\n      do 语法\n      async/await\n      for 推导\n      ? 运算符\n    直觉\n      可能失败\n      异步\n      多结果\n      带状态</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Monad</strong> 通过 <code>flatMap</code> 解决了 map 产生的嵌套上下文问题，实现链式计算。</li>\n<li>三条 <strong>Monad 定律</strong>保证 flatMap 链可以自由重组而不改变结果。</li>\n<li><strong>do 语法</strong>（Haskell）和 <strong>async/await</strong>（JS/TS）本质上都是 Monad 链的语法糖。</li>\n<li>Promise 的 <code>.then()</code> 就是 flatMap——JavaScript 开发者每天都在使用 Monad。</li>\n<li>Monad 的核心价值：将&quot;如何处理上下文&quot;与&quot;如何处理值&quot;彻底分离。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Monad 基础","id":"monad-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Functor 到 Monad","id":"从-functor-到-monad"},{"level":2,"text":"Monad 定律","id":"monad-定律"},{"level":2,"text":"do 语法与 async/await","id":"do-语法与-async-await"},{"level":2,"text":"Monad 的直觉模型","id":"monad-的直觉模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"函子与 map","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/functor-and-map"},"next":{"title":"常见 Monad","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/functors-and-monads/common-monads"}}